<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>献文舎｜会員チャット</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="chat.css?v=1"></head>
